BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventjumbospumpkinpatchfallfestival11483-20261002@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260928T180439Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261002
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261003
SUMMARY:Jumbo's Pumpkin Patch Fall Festival
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with a full day of festive fun for all ages at Jumbo’s Pumpkin Patch! From classic farm adventures to fall-themed attractions\, our Fall Fun Festival is the perfect weekend outing for families\, friends\, and pumpkin lovers. What’s Included with Admission: Your ticket includes unlimited access to a variety of seasonal attractions: Hayrides through the farm 30+ acre u-pick pumpkin patch (pumpkins sold by the pound) Corn maze (14 acres) Petting zoo Jumping pillow Giant slides Mini mazes for younger guests Playgrounds and yard games General Store with fall shopping and décor​ Optional Add-Ons: (Available for Purchase Onsite - Saturday and Sunday Only) Enhance your day with these fun extras: Pony Rides – $7 Face Painting – $4 Sandy Candy (Edible Sand Art) – $4 Corn Cannon – $5 (3 shots) ​ Food & Drinks: Come hungry! A variety of food\, snacks\, and beverages are available for purchase\, including selections from Liquidity Ale Works of Mt. Airy. Tickets available online or at the gate.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/jumbos-pumpkin-patch-fall-festival/11483/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventmackberryband26173-20261002@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260928T180439Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261002
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261003
SUMMARY:Mack Berry Band
DESCRIPTION:Since their formation in 2023\, the Mack Berry Band has taken their high-energy live shows to stages across the Mid-Atlantic\, from intimate venues to festivals and country fairs. Hailing from Western Maryland\, the band has steadily gained recognition for their dynamic performances and their ability to merge their country rock influences with modern storytelling. Returning from Nashville from recording their second EP\, the Mack Berry Band continues to distinguish themselves to their rapidly growing fan base
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/mack-berry-band/26173/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgevent14thannualgravitysocialfallfestivalanddualslalom17437-20261003@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260928T180439Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:14th Annual Gravity Social Fall Festival and Dual Slalom
DESCRIPTION:Come check out the 14th Annual Gravity Social Dual Slalom Race & Festival at Old Harmony Farm on October 3rd in Myersville\, Maryland. Join 1\,000+ spectators for Maryland's premier grassroots dual slalom mountain bike race hosted by Gravity Social\, a non-profit dedicated to promoting competitive racing for all ages and experience levels! This unique Frederick County sporting event attracts 200+ racers from across the region to compete head-to-head in thrilling elimination-style races. Perfect for families - enjoy live music\, food trucks\, beer garden\, and onsite camping\, while watching exciting mountain bike racing just 15 minutes from downtown Frederick! Open to all skill levels from striders to pros\, making it a true community celebration of outdoor sports in beautiful Frederick County.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/14th-annual-gravity-social-fall-festival-and-dual-slalom/17437/
END:VEVENT
